{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"cf6d7cae-5ff0-4486-9a94-e41d2bfaa2e3","status":"SUCCESS","response":"All requirements and edge cases specified in `INSTRUCTIONS.md` and the Phase 1 Compact Plan have been implemented and verified:\n\n1. **AST Node Invariants (`ast_nodes.py`)**:\n   - `Field`: validates `name` matches `[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*`.\n   - `Literal`: accepts `str`, `int`, and finite `float` (strictly rejects `bool`, `nan`, `inf`).\n   - `Comparison`: validates `field`, `op`, and `literal`. Enforces `like` requires `str` and `\u003c`, `\u003c=`, `\u003e`, `\u003e=` require numeric values (`int` or `float`).\n   - `And` / `Or`: normalizes and validates `children` into a non-empty tuple of valid AST nodes.\n   - `Not`: validates that `child` is an AST node.\n   - All violations raise `ValueError`.\n\n2. **Parser Precedence and Tokenization (`parser.py`)**:\n   - Operator precedence is strictly `NOT` \u003e `AND` \u003e `OR`.\n   - Reserved keywords (`AND`, `OR`, `NOT`, `like`) cannot be field names.\n   - `=` is equality; `==` raises `ValueError`.\n   - Single-quoted string literal escaping and numeric literal parsing (`int` and `float`) strictly enforced.\n   - Trailing tokens, unbalanced parentheses, empty queries, and incomplete comparisons raise `ValueError`.\n\n3. **Validator Enforcement (`validator.py`)**:\n   - Recursively inspects every `Field` node across comparisons, logical `And`/`Or`, and `Not` constructs against the allowlist, raising `ValueError` naming the field, or returning the node on success.\n\n4. **Safe SQL Compiler (`compiler.py`)**:\n   - Runs validation first against `allowed_fields`.\n   - Emits parameterized SQL using `?` placeholders and returns extracted literals in `params` in depth-first order.\n   - Maps `like` operator to SQL `LIKE`.\n   - Emits wrapping parentheses around `And`/`Or` clauses and `NOT (...)` for negation.\n\nVerification passed with `python -m pytest -q --tb=short`.\n","duration_seconds":59.6308084,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":41908,"output_tokens":4939,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":174132,"total_tokens":46847}}}
